			"notes": "SkinManager — UnsupportedOperationException Cause: In the new Authlib, `profile.getProperties()` returns an `ImmutableListMultimap`, and `removeAll()` throws an exception. Fix via reflection: retrieve the private `delegate` field from the `ForwardingMultimap` and replace it with a fresh `ArrayListMultimap` containing the new texture.\n\nNickManager reason: `tabListDisplayName` is a private field; without it, the package sent the old name. Fix: Set the field via reflection before sending the package.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Desside-Developer/UnstableSmpMod/compare/1.0...1.1.2"
		},
